    <string name="about">About Zerium</string>
    <string name="about_body">Zerium Browser v%1$s\n\nA free and open-source privacy browser for Android, licensed under GPL-3.0. No accounts, no analytics, no ads of its own.\n\nEngine: Android System WebView\nBlocking: StevenBlack hosts (MIT) + curated element-hiding rules\n\nThis is an honest early release: some engine-level limitations apply and are documented in the repository README.</string>

